@startuml deployment
title CQL Studio Platform Deployment Footprint & Architecture

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45

cloud "Client Layer" as Clients {
  actor "Developer / Author\n(Browser)" as DevUser
  [Ollama LLM Runner\n(Local / Remote)] as OllamaRunner
  [NLM VSAC FHIR API\n(cts.nlm.nih.gov)] as VsacApi
  [SearXNG Web Search\n(Search Instance)] as SearxngApi
}

node "CQL Studio UI" as UiTier {
  [Angular SPA\n(CodeMirror 6 & Bootstrap 5)] as UI
  [PGlite WebAssembly\n(In-Browser SQL on FHIR)] as PGliteEngine
}

node "CQL Studio Server (Express / Node.js ESM)" as ServerTier {
  [BFF Auth & Sessions\n(HttpOnly Cookies)] as BffAuth
  [Team & Workspace Service\n(IAM & Activity Log)] as TeamService
  [MCP Tool Orchestrator\n(Model Context Protocol)] as McpEngine
  [Ollama Proxy\n(CORS Bypass)] as OllamaProxy
  [VSAC ValueSet Proxy\n(Authoritative Discovery)] as VsacProxy
}

node "Identity & SSO" as SsoTier {
  [Authentik SSO Server\n(OIDC Provider)] as AuthentikServer
  [Authentik Worker] as AuthentikWorker
}

node "FHIR Storage Layer" as FhirTier {
  [HAPI FHIR R4 JPA\n(CQL Evaluation & Libraries)] as HapiR4
}

database "PostgreSQL 18" as DatabaseTier {
  database "CQL Studio DB\n(Prisma Schema)" as AppDb
  database "Authentik DB" as AuthentikDb
}

DevUser --> UI : HTTPS (Port 4200)
UI --> ServerTier : REST API & MCP (Port 3003)\n(Session Cookie)
UI --> HapiR4 : FHIR REST API / $evaluate (Port 8080)
DevUser ..> AuthentikServer : OIDC Authorize (BFF flow)
BffAuth --> AuthentikServer : Token Exchange / Discovery (Port 9000)

OllamaProxy --> OllamaRunner : Native API Forwarding
VsacProxy --> VsacApi : FHIR ValueSet Search & Validation
McpEngine --> SearxngApi : Anonymous Search Queries

ServerTier --> AppDb : Prisma ORM (Port 5432)
AuthentikServer --> AuthentikDb : Relational Store

note right of McpEngine
  MCP Tool Orchestration provides
  web searching, page fetching,
  feed extraction, and authoritative
  VSAC ValueSet resolution to AI agents.
end note

note bottom of UI
  Includes full CQL editor,
  ELM AST inspector, Test Runner,
  and in-browser SQL on FHIR engine via PGlite.
end note

@enduml
